NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — satiation (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:07.835
<v Narrator>Àwọn iṣẹ́ gbogbo ní àká-ìparí, àti àwọn iṣẹ́ kọ̀ǹpútà tí a fi pamọ́ láti inú ohun náà.

2
00:00:07.915 --> 00:00:17.770
<v Narrator>Keji, iṣẹ kọmputa ti o dara julọ ṣe ki awọn eniyan bẹrẹ ọpọlọpọ awọn iṣẹ diẹ sii, nitorinaa lilo gbogbogbo le tẹsiwaju lati pọ si.

3
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:24.190
<v Narrator>Keji, awọn idiyele owo fun AI n pọ si ni iyara, ṣugbọn agbara ti o fi kun ko jẹ ọfẹ.
